35,2,1,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, I found it! Separate rooms cost 8,000 yen more each! But all-in rates charge light eaters the same as big eaters. Which one is the real trap?","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, the ferry schedule is a disaster. Two full days lost to transit. Last year’s separate days were a waste. We need a destination that minimizes travel overhead.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, the all-in rate is a hidden tax on the frugal. I found whole-house lets at 5,400 yen per head, with food separate. That structure is transparent.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, two days lost? That’s brutal. But I found the real killer: one bathroom for the whole building, and dinner at six sharp. I can’t sleep if I’m rushed.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"@Shunichi, the separate days explain the emptiness. The house explains the crowding. We need a place that forces us to share the day, but leaves room to breathe.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, 5,400 yen per head is clear! But if food is separate, the bill changes every day. I need the total before we go!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Takumi, one bathroom is a bottleneck, not a destination flaw. The ferry is the real thief. I need a place where we arrive and stay, not a transit hub.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, the variable cost is the point. If we buy meals separately, the bill reflects actual consumption, not a flat average. That is equitable.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, a bottleneck is a trap. If I’m waiting for a bath, I’m stuck. I need a place where I can wash and eat without being herded.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, a bottleneck is a different kind of crowding. I need the shared day, but I also need the space to step away. We must find that balance.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, I get the fairness! But I hate guessing the food bill. If we pick the whole house, can we set a strict daily food limit so the total stays predictable?","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, a food limit is a band-aid. The ferry schedule is the disease. I need a destination where the transit overhead is negligible, not a place where we argue over rice.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, a limit is arbitrary. The structure is what matters. If the bill reflects actual consumption, no one is subsidizing another’s appetite. That is the only fair baseline.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, I don’t care about the ferry. I care about the clock. If dinner is at six and the bath is cold, I’m done. I need my own time.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Shunichi, the ferry is a constraint, not the core. I need a place that shares the day but allows private hours. I will check the ferry sailings and train time.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, checking the ferry is smart! But I still need the total cost. If we can’t predict the food bill, I can’t agree. I’m stuck!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@Toshio, the ferry is the disease, not the symptom. I need a destination where we arrive and stay, not a transit hub. I am done.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"I am done. The structure is clear. I will vote for the option where the bill reflects actual consumption, not a flat average.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Takumi,,"I’m done. I need a place where I can wash and eat without being herded. If the clock rules me, I’m out.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Toshio,,I am done. The data confirms the need for a shared day with private space. I will vote for the option that balances togetherness with the ability to step away.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
